TITLE Equilibrate pure water with fixed-pressure gas phase at 150C; get SI of N2(g)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
GAS_PHASE 1 Fixed P=1 atm, T=150C
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 150
    -pressure 1
    CH4(g) 10
    CO2(g) 10
    NH3(g) 5
    N2(g) 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -si N2(g)
END
